{"id":1000417,"slug":"six-moral-tales","title":"Six Moral Tales","year":null,"country":null,"duration":null,"spine":342,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/boxsets/417-six-moral-tales","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/product_images/1875-4d5d5e2c0c2e29fa19513f6dc62869f6/uCMcMymA2Obfiryf0OHp2HPNItUlPx_large.jpg","description":"The multifaceted, deeply personal work of Eric Rohmer has had an effect on cinema unlike any other. One of the founding critics of the history-making Cahiers du cinéma, Rohmer began translating his written manifestos to film in the 1960s, standing apart from his New Wave contemporaries with his patented brand of gently existential, hyperarticulate character studies set against vivid seasonal landscapes. This near genre unto itself was established with the audacious and wildly influential series Six Moral Tales. A succession of encounters between fragile men and the women who tempt them, Six Moral Tales unleashed on the film world a new voice, one that was at once sexy, philosophical, modern, daring, nonjudgmental, and liberating.","boxset":1,"scraped":1,"directors":[],"cast":[],"credits":[],"pickedBy":[{"session":949,"title":"Jack Harlow’s Closet Picks","date":"2026-03-23","video":"https://vimeo.com/1182665521","celebs":[{"id":19,"name":"Jack Harlow"}]},{"session":925,"title":"Mary Bronstein’s Closet Picks","date":"2025-10-01","video":"https://vimeo.com/1162620718","celebs":[{"id":73,"name":"Mary Bronstein"}]},{"session":820,"title":"Natasha Lyonne’s Closet Picks","date":"2025-05-08","video":"https://vimeo.com/1084625166","celebs":[{"id":111,"name":"Natasha Lyonne"}]},{"session":790,"title":"Carrie Coon’s Closet Picks","date":"2025-02-19","video":"https://vimeo.com/1065975314","celebs":[{"id":138,"name":"Carrie Coon"}]},{"session":630,"title":"Nuri Bilge Ceylan’s Closet Picks","date":"2023-10-10","video":"https://vimeo.com/915256707","celebs":[{"id":251,"name":"Nuri Bilge Ceylan"}]},{"session":570,"title":"Christian Petzold’s